---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Ryan Huntzicker" description="A Bit About Ryan">
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<Hero
				title="About"
				tagline="Thanks for stopping by! Stay a while, get to know me a bit."
			>
				<img
					width="1553"
					height="873"
					src="/assets/portrait.jpg"
					alt="Jeanine White at work with a colleague"
				/>
			</Hero>

			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Background</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>
						With a background rooted in both high-performance sales and technical systems, I’ve carved out a unique lane as a high ticket closer for SaaS platforms, marketing agencies, and startups. I specialize in closing high-value deals by combining strategic sales engineering with psychological insight, tailoring each pitch to the pain points and ambitions of the prospect. Whether I’m selling a $2,000/month SaaS plan or a $25,000 website retainer, I know how to create urgency, anchor value, and guide decision-makers to “yes” with confidence.
					</p>
					<p>
						Before stepping into sales full-time, I built my career in web development and systems programming — launching scalable web apps, API-driven software, and blockchain experiments using frameworks like Next.js, Laravel, and React. That technical fluency gives me an edge in high-ticket environments: I don’t just sell the product — I understand it inside and out, and I speak the same language as both the engineering team and the client.

My mission is simple: Close deals that make a real impact. Whether it’s through cold calls, outbound DMs, webinars, or live demos, I build trust fast, handle objections with precision, and move conversations from curiosity to contract. I’m not here to sell features — I sell outcomes, and I make sure every prospect knows exactly what they’re walking away with.

If you're looking for a closer who understands how to position complex digital products, navigate tough objections, and drive revenue with discipline and speed — that's what I do.
					</p>
					
				</div>
			</section>
			
			
		</main>

		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	img {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
	}

	section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.section-title {
		grid-column-start: 1;
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content {
		grid-column: 2 / 4;
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
		transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
	}

	.content :global(a:hover),
	.content :global(a:focus) {
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.about {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
		}

		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}

		section {
			display: contents;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
	}
</style>
